authorized, for and on behalf of the Company, to do all such other acts or things necessary or desirable to implement, carry out and
give effect to the Share Consolidation, if and when deemed advisable by the Board of Directors in its sole discretion (&ldquo;Proposal
Eight&rdquo;).</TD>
